&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hybrid approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working together in person helps us move faster, collaborate better and build a great Liberis culture. Our hybrid working approach requires colleagues to attend the office at least three days a week, increasing to at least four days a week in Q1 2027&lt;/p&gt;
