&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Scale, our mission is to develop reliable AI systems for the world&#39;s most important decisions. Our products provide the high-quality data and full-stack technologies that power the world&#39;s leading models, and help enterprises and governments build, deploy, and oversee AI applications that deliver real impact. We work closely with industry leaders like Meta, &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ernst&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; Young, Mayo Clinic, Time Inc., the Government of Qatar, and U.S. government agencies including the Army and Air Force. We are expanding our team to accelerate the development of AI applications.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe that everyone should be able to bring their whole selves to work, which is why we are proud to be an inclusive and equal opportunity workplace. We are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability status, gender identity or Veteran status.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with physical and mental disabilities. If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation in the application or recruiting process due to a disability, please contact us at ----- Please see the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights poster&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We comply with the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pay Transparency provision&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLEASE NOTE: &lt;/strong&gt;We collect, retain and use personal data for our professional business purposes, including notifying you of job opportunities that may be of interest and sharing with our affiliates. We limit the personal data we collect to that which we believe is appropriate and necessary to manage applicants’ needs, provide our services, and comply with applicable laws. Any information we collect in connection with your application will be treated in accordance with our internal policies and programs designed to protect personal data. Please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://scale.com/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://fin.ai/&quot;&gt;Fin&lt;/a&gt;, now part of Salesforce, is on a mission to help businesses provide perfect customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AI Agent Fin is the highest-performing AI Customer Agent on the market today, enabling businesses to deliver impeccable, always-on customer support across the customer journey, from service, to sales, to ecommerce. Powered by our own AI models, Fin resolves complex customer issues end-to-end across every channel, with minimal set-up and integration. Fin can also be combined with our natively integrated Intercom help desk, giving modern support teams one single system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together with Salesforce, the #1 AI CRM, where humans with agents drive customer success, we&#39;re building the future of customer experience. Here, ambition meets action. Tech meets trust. And innovation isn&#39;t a buzzword, it&#39;s a way of life. The world of work as we know it is changing, and we&#39;re looking for Trailblazers who are passionate about bettering business and the world through AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to level up your career at the company leading workforce transformation in the agentic era? You&#39;re in the right place. Agentforce is the future of AI, and you are the future of Salesforce.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s the opportunity?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Self-serve is where the majority of our customers start their journey, and the Growth team owns that journey end to end. &lt;strong&gt;This role owns the self-serve&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;existing business&lt;/strong&gt;: once a customer converts to paid, the account is yours - through every stage of its lifecycle, as it adopts more of the platform, grows its usage, and deepens its reliance on Fin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mandate is to grow the value of the self-serve base: drive expansion, strengthen retention, and accelerate adoption of Fin and our newest products across thousands of paying customers. You&#39;ll own a book of business, a roadmap, and a cross-functional motion that spans product, lifecycle, data, and go-to-market. It&#39;s a rare Growth remit with a clear number to move and a lot of room to build the motions that move it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What will I be doing?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the self-serve existing business book.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the remit end to end - from the moment a customer converts to the point they renew, expand, or leave - and be accountable for the net growth of that book.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow Fin adoption.&lt;/strong&gt; Get more customers using our AI Agent across the existing base, and help the customers who already use it automate more of their support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Defend and expand.&lt;/strong&gt; Build the retention and expansion motions that grow the book - combining in-product experiences, lifecycle messaging, and a data/signal layer that flags which accounts need attention and when.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect self-serve and sales.&lt;/strong&gt; Design smooth, well-defined handovers between self-serve and sales in both directions, so the right customers get the right motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix the key journeys.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with core product teams to remove friction on the journeys that matter most to self-serve customers - onboarding and activation, Fin setup and go-live, plan changes and expansion, billing and plan management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Land new products &amp;amp; features.&lt;/strong&gt; Drive attach and adoption of new products &amp;amp; features across the self-serve base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understand the customer.&lt;/strong&gt; Deeply understand the customers you&#39;re serving through research, data, and direct interactions, and turn that understanding into a clear, prioritised roadmap you communicate to build alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and ship.&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with engineers and designers to ideate, build, and ship solutions, and leverage AI to increase your efficiency and accelerate product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure impact.&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate impact through quantitative and qualitative measures, own product quality, and model our company values and R&amp;amp;D principles in how you lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What skills do I need?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no minimum years of experience, and no need to have held the PM title. We care about your impact, drive, and potential - former founders, strategy &amp;amp; operations leaders, and consultants are as welcome as career PMs. The common thread is end-to-end ownership of a problem and the outcomes that follow. We&#39;ll be looking for evidence you&#39;ve applied and grown these skills:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and lifecycle expertise.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve owned retention, expansion, adoption, or monetisation for a self-serve or product-led business, and you know how to move those numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sharp customer focus and problem framing.&lt;/strong&gt; You get to the real customer problem through research, data, and direct conversations before deciding what to build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong data fluency.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re comfortable working with funnels, cohorts, and customer signals to find opportunity, size it, and measure impact - and you make decisions from evidence, not instinct.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compelling roadmaps.&lt;/strong&gt; You build and communicate a roadmap that makes the what, when, and why obvious to everyone who needs to align behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent product judgment.&lt;/strong&gt; You balance customer needs, business impact, and technical constraints, and you know what to ship now versus later.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; You drive outcomes across product, design, engineering, data, lifecycle marketing, CS, and sales - influencing teams you don&#39;t own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluency.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand how LLMs and AI agents work well enough to assess feasibility, make informed product decisions, and use AI to accelerate your own work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcome-oriented.&lt;/strong&gt; You define success clearly, share progress openly, and hold yourself to measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unleash Your Potential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join Salesforce, you’ll be limitless in all areas of your life. Our benefits and resources support you to find balance and be your best, and our AI agents accelerate your impact so you can do your best. Together, we’ll bring the power of Agentforce to organizations of all sizes and deliver amazing experiences that customers love. Apply today to not only shape the future — but to redefine what’s possible — for yourself, for AI, and the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the United States, compensation offered will be determined by factors such as location, job level, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. Certain roles may be eligible for incentive compensation, equity, and benefits. At Fin, we want to give people what they need to do the best work of their careers. Our benefits and programs are designed to support your health and wellbeing, your family, your time away from work, and your financial future. Offerings vary by location in line with local practices and requirements. Learn more about working at Fin and the benefits we offer at&lt;a href=&quot;http://fin.ai/careers&quot;&gt; fin.ai/careers&lt;/a&gt;. Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance and the Los Angeles Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring, Salesforce will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fin has a hybrid working policy. We believe that working in person helps us stay connected, collaborate easier and create a great culture while still providing flexibility to work from home. We expect employees to be in the office at least three days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a radically open and accepting culture at Fin. We avoid spending time on divisive subjects to foster a safe and cohesive work environment for everyone. As an organization, our policy is to not advocate on behalf of the company or our employees on any social or political topics out of our internal or external communications. We respect personal opinion and expression on these topics on personal social platforms on personal time, and do not challenge or confront anyone for their views on non-work related topics. Our goal is to focus on doing incredible work to achieve our goals and unite the company through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.intercom.com/careers&quot;&gt;core values&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salesforce is an equal opportunity employer and maintains a policy of non-discrimination with all employees and applicants for employment. What does that mean exactly? It means that at Salesforce, we believe in equality for all. And we believe we can lead the path to equality in part by creating a workplace that’s inclusive, and free from discrimination.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/know-your-rights-workplace-discrimination-illegal&quot;&gt;Know your rights: workplace discrimination is illegal.&lt;/a&gt; Any employee or potential employee will be assessed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications – without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, transgender status, age, disability, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other classifications protected by law. This policy applies to current and prospective employees, no matter where they are in their Salesforce employment journey. It also applies to recruiting, hiring, job assignment, compensation, promotion, benefits, training, assessment of job performance, discipline, termination, and everything in between. Recruiting, hiring, and promotion decisions at Salesforce are fair and based on merit. The same goes for compensation, benefits, promotions, transfers, reduction in workforce, recall, training, and education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ogilvy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy more than 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity—innovating at the intersection of intelligence, imagination and influence, with experts across advertising, sports &amp;amp; entertainment, PR &amp;amp; social, consulting, and health collaborating seamlessly across more than 120 offices spanning 90 countries. Ogilvy was named &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-brings-home-network-year-2026-cannes-lions-international-festival-creativity&quot;&gt;Network of the Year&lt;/a&gt; at the 2026 Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-tops-warc-effective-100-creative-100-4th-straight-year&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;e2c78315-ff05-4544-925f-9288319dea2c&quot;&gt;ranks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC for the fourth consecutive year, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ogilvy.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;39833259-880d-4fd8-930f-0d84b1c14850&quot;&gt;Ogilvy.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow us on&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;735e393e-6e8a-4ca8-804a-74f1bd8166b6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ogilvy&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d10960ce-761b-48c5-81d5-0a7c4cc6013a&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;92ffcb70-6ca7-4d9a-88d5-c130e36e6c4f&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;3bd2010d-00a2-401b-8cfb-7e8c24deac52&quot;&gt; Facebook.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Studio Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Department: &lt;/strong&gt;WPP / Ogilvy&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;London / National&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Time/Part time:&lt;/strong&gt; Full Time&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting into:&lt;/strong&gt; WPP Lead&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Studio Director within the Studio Network—a dynamic WPP-operated brand amplification powerhouse—you will be at the helm of creating and scaling distinctive, platform-native content across Europe. Your core mission is to seamlessly run one of our studios, acting as the trusted partner and strategic advisor for brand marketers. You will lead a talented core team, orchestrate creative delivery, and continuously elevate the quality of our output, ensuring our studio remains the go-to destination for every brand brief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy, we are guided by David Ogilvy’s core values: &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing, Do the Best Work of Our Lives,&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Do It Together.&lt;/em&gt; If these principles resonate with you, we’d love for you to join us in shaping what’s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct the studio’s daily operations under the clients leadership, ensuring every brief meets agreed standards and service levels are consistently achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Lasting Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Become the trusted face of the studio to brand marketers across your markets. You&#39;ll join their planning sessions, showcase results, and proactively remove any roadblocks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize and Orchestrate:&lt;/strong&gt; Smartly match capacity to demand, balancing your core team, flexible resources, and the wider network bench to handle workflow peaks smoothly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate the Creative Standard:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the guardian of quality, overseeing decision gates, tracking compliance to our 100% KPI, and ensuring we hit high scores on the clients Creative Scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Seamlessly manage the daily workflow with our global delivery centres (India and South Africa), ensuring flawless quality control before assets reach client approvers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the quarterly studio scorecard, pinpointing and driving at least one major operational improvement each quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Your Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Foster a supportive environment focused on retention and growth. Lead onboarding, ongoing training, and certify the team on every new brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Key Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership in running a high-volume, high-quality creative or content studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional stakeholder management skills, with a knack for building trust with senior brand marketers and navigating complex matrix structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational acumen, including capacity planning, resource management, and workflow optimization across global delivery centres.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sharp eye for creative quality and platform-native content, with experience using data and performance metrics to measure and elevate output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving abilities, capable of turning scorecard data into actionable quarterly improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for people development, with a track record of building, retaining, and growing high-performing teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are a natural leader who thrives at the intersection of operational excellence and creative brilliance. You don&#39;t just manage processes; you inspire teams and build unshakeable trust with clients. You are commercially savvy, culturally fluent, and possess a proactive mindset that spots opportunities for improvement before they become issues. If you are ready to drive an engine that produces world-class content for one of the world&#39;s most iconic brand portfolios, and you love seeing your team grow alongside the work, you&#39;ll be right at home here.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Ogilvy, we are a friendly, collaborative, and eclectic team united by a shared commitment to doing the best work of our lives. Beyond client work, you’ll have the chance to shape our vibrant culture, join active social teams, and contribute to our industry-leading DEI initiatives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here is a snapshot of the benefits we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Working:&lt;/strong&gt; We embrace a hybrid model that blends collaborative in-office time with the flexibility to work remotely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Leave:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days holiday, a paid volunteering day, plus the option to buy up to 5 additional days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pension:&lt;/strong&gt; a generous matched scheme. Contribute 4% (Ogilvy pays 6%) up to a maximum contribution of 7% (Ogilvy pays 10.5%—totalling a powerful 17.5%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare &amp;amp; Wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; BUPA Private Medical Insurance, plus discounted BUPA dental cover or financial contribution towards your physical and mental wellness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Assistance:&lt;/strong&gt; 24/7 access to remote GPs, mental health support, physio, nutrition consultations, and confidential counselling for you and your family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Free 1-to-1 Coaching:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional and personal growth coaching sessions annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life Assurance &amp;amp; Income Protection:&lt;/strong&gt; Financial peace of mind for you and your loved ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy champions innovation and the thoughtful application of AI. We encourage you to use AI tools to enhance your application and achieve the best possible results. During interviews, we may explore how you leverage AI, showcasing your judgment and ability to integrate these technologies effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please ensure your application authentically reflects your own skills, experience, and unique contributions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy, our people are at the heart of what we do: a creative agency that sparks game-changing ideas across culture and business through collaboration, integrity, and a celebration of self-expression.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in building powerful teams with purpose - and we relentlessly curate transformative initiatives that make our commitment to fairness, and equity a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ultimate mission is to leave a positive impact on the world, creating a better future for all, while supporting and uplifting the global communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; This is central to our mantra of Borderless Creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ogilvy is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
